gamemate-commentary-v2.gguf, gamemate-commentary-shooter-v3.gguf,
gamemate-commentary-sports-v3.gguf and gamemate-commentary-adventure-v3.gguf are LoRA adapters for
LFM2.5-1.2B-Instruct by Liquid AI, Inc.

They were made by GameMate by fine-tuning that model on hand-written comments for game moments
(the last three each on one kind of game only), so they are modified versions of the model. They
are distributed under the LFM Open License v1.0 in the LICENSE file next to them.

GameMate downloads the base model itself from Liquid AI's page on Hugging Face:
https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM2.5-1.2B-Instruct-GGUF
